{"title":"Career Roadmap · DevOps Trainee","role":"DevOps Trainee","summary":"A DevOps Trainee is an entry-level technology professional who learns and supports the processes used to build, test, deploy, monitor and maintain software applications.","facts":{"Current degree":"BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)","Course":"BCA – Cloud Computing / DevOps"},"about":[{"label":"Career Area","text":"DevOps / Cloud / Infrastructure / Platform Engineering"},{"label":"Entry Potential","text":"Strong"},{"label":"Typical Experience","text":"0–1 year"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A DevOps Trainee is an entry-level technology professional who learns and supports the processes used to build, test, deploy, monitor and maintain software applications."},{"type":"p","text":"For a BCA specialising in Cloud Computing / DevOps, this is a highly relevant entry pathway."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Software Development","Cloud Infrastructure","Automation","Operations"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A DevOps Trainee should not be expected to independently architect complex cloud infrastructure on day one. The initial objective is to develop strong foundations in:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Linux","Networking","Git","Cloud","Docker","CI/CD","Infrastructure as Code","Monitoring"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A practical progression is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA Cloud/DevOps","DevOps Trainee","Junior DevOps Engineer","DevOps Engineer","Senior DevOps Engineer","Lead/Platform Engineer","DevOps/Cloud Architect"]}]},{"heading":"What Does a DevOps Trainee Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supporting CI/CD pipelines"},{"text":"Managing development environments"},{"text":"Assisting with cloud infrastructure"},{"text":"Monitoring applications"},{"text":"Troubleshooting deployment issues"},{"text":"Managing source-code repositories"},{"text":"Writing automation scripts"},{"text":"Working with Docker containers"},{"text":"Supporting infrastructure provisioning"},{"text":"Checking logs"},{"text":"Managing environment variables and secrets"},{"text":"Supporting application deployments"},{"text":"Assisting with incident resolution"},{"text":"Maintaining technical documentation"},{"text":"Supporting developers during releases"}]},{"type":"p","text":"At trainee level, the focus is primarily on learning, automation and operational support."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Position","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Cloud/DevOps Student"},{"text":"Linux + networking"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Cloud/DevOps Intern"},{"text":"Cloud & containers"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"DevOps Intern"},{"text":"CI/CD + automation"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"DevOps Project/Intern"},{"text":"Production-style workflows"}],[{"text":"0–1 year"},{"text":"DevOps Trainee"},{"text":"Support & automation"}],[{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Junior DevOps Engineer"},{"text":"CI/CD + cloud"}],[{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"DevOps Engineer"},{"text":"Infrastructure & reliability"}],[{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Senior DevOps / Platform Engineer"},{"text":"Architecture"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Cloud/DevOps Architect"},{"text":"Strategy & platform design"}]]}]},{"heading":"Build Linux Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Linux is one of the most important foundations for DevOps."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Linux commands"},{"type":"p","text":"ls"},{"type":"p","text":"cd"},{"type":"p","text":"pwd"},{"type":"p","text":"cp"},{"type":"p","text":"mv"},{"type":"p","text":"rm"},{"type":"p","text":"mkdir"},{"type":"p","text":"cat"},{"type":"p","text":"grep"},{"type":"p","text":"find"},{"type":"p","text":"tail"},{"type":"p","text":"head"},{"type":"