oices include:"},{"type":"h","text":"MCA"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Software engineering"},{"text":"Cloud computing"},{"text":"IT"},{"text":"Distributed systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Cloud Computing"},{"text":"Information Technology"},{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.Tech"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cloud Computing"},{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Distributed Systems"},{"text":"Information Security"},{"text":"Software Engineering"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility varies by institution, particularly for BCA graduates, so verify the current admission criteria."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant master's programmes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cloud Computing"},{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Software Engineering"},{"text":"Distributed Systems"},{"text":"Information Technology"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"DevOps/Cloud Engineering"},{"text":"Systems Engineering"},{"text":"Computer Networks"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Check programme-specific requirements regarding:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BCA degree structure"},{"text":"Mathematics"},{"text":"Programming credits"},{"text":"Computer science credits"},{"text":"English proficiency"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A technical path could be:"},{"type":"h","text":"BCA Cloud/DevOps"},{"type":"h","text":"DevOps Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"DevOps Trainee"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior DevOps Engineer"},{"type":"h","text":"DevOps Engineer"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior DevOps Engineer"},{"type":"h","text":"Lead DevOps Engineer"},{"type":"h","text":"Staff/Principal Platform Engineer"},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud/DevOps Architect"},{"type":"p","text":"Alternative:"},{"type":"h","text":"DevOps → SRE"},{"type":"