"}]},{"heading":"2030–2045 Future Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"High-value combinations include:"},{"type":"h","text":"DevOps + AI"},{"type":"h","text":"AIOps + predictive operations"},{"type":"h","text":"DevOps + Security"},{"type":"h","text":"DevSecOps + cloud security"},{"type":"h","text":"DevOps + Kubernetes"},{"type":"h","text":"Platform engineering"},{"type":"h","text":"DevOps + Cloud"},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud architecture"},{"type":"h","text":"DevOps + Data"},{"type":"h","text":"Observability + analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"DevOps + Automation"},{"type":"h","text":"Autonomous infrastructure operations"}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Before applying for DevOps Trainee positions, aim to have:"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1"},{"type":"h","text":"Dockerised application"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2"},{"type":"h","text":"CI/CD pipeline"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3"},{"type":"h","text":"Terraform cloud infrastructure"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4"},{"type":"h","text":"Kubernetes deployment"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5"},{"type":"h","text":"Monitoring & observability dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"At least one project should demonstrate the complete workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Code","Git","CI/CD","Docker","Infrastructure as Code","Cloud","Monitoring"]},{"type":"p","text":"That single end-to-end project can become the centrepiece of the student's portfolio."}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to:"},{"type":"p","text":"Deploy a containerised application to the cloud, automate its build and deployment through CI/CD, provision infrastructure using Terraform, troubleshoot Linux and networking issues, configure basic Kubernetes resources, monitor application health, manage cloud permissions securely and automate repetitive operational tasks using Python/Bash."},{"type":"p","text":"That is a strong foundation for an entry-level DevOps career."},{"type":"h","text":"Best Practical Path"},{"type":"h","text":"BCA – Cloud Computing / DevOps"},{"type":"flow","items":["Linux + Networking","Git + GitHub","Bash + Python","AWS/Azure/GCP","Docker","CI/CD","Terraform","Kubernetes","Monitoring & Observability","Cloud Security / DevSecOps","DevOps Internship","DevOps Trainee","Junior DevOps Engineer","DevOps Engineer","Senior DevOps Engineer","Platform/SRE/Cloud Engineer","Cloud/DevOps Architect"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best long-term combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["Linux","Cloud","Docker","Kubernetes","Terraform","CI/CD","Python","Observability","Security"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This combination makes the BCA graduate suitable not only for traditional DevOps roles but also for the growing areas of Cloud Engineering, Site Reliability Engineering, Platform Engineering, DevSecOps and AIOps."}]}]}